{
  "display": "form",
  "name": "seededInputForm",
  "title": "Seeded input fields",
  "type": "form",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "content",
      "key": "uitleg",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "html": "<h3>Putting zaak and taak data into editable fields</h3><p>Every field below is a normal Form.io input &mdash; a textfield, a textarea, a date picker &mdash; that ZAC has filled in from the zaak or the taak. Give it the attribute <code>ZAC_TYPE</code> of <code>ZAC_zaak_gegevens</code> or <code>ZAC_taak_gegevens</code> and the property <code>ZAC_VELD</code> with the path to read, and the value is seeded into the field. Because the field itself holds the value, no extra property is needed to say so: put the same declaration on a <code>content</code> component and ZAC tells you to use <code>{{ }}</code> instead.</p><p>Reading a value for <em>display</em> is not done here at all &mdash; write <code>{{ zaak.identificatie }}</code> in a content component. Seeding is the one thing <code>{{ }}</code> cannot do, because Form.io skips a default value once the submission already carries the key.</p><p>Use <code>ZAC_FORMAAT</code> only where the value is read as text. An input that parses its own value &mdash; a date picker &mdash; needs the raw value, so leave the format off and let the picker do the formatting. Each field's description shows the declaration that filled it. Change a value, press <em>Save</em>, then reopen the task: your answer is kept and not seeded over.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Seeded from the zaak",
      "key": "seeded_from_zaak",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "label": "Zaaknummer (editable)",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakIdentificatie",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: identificatie",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "identificatie"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Omschrijving",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakOmschrijving",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: omschrijving",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "omschrijving"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Startdatum as text (datum format)",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakStartdatum",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: startdatum · ZAC_FORMAAT: datum — a textfield, so the formatted text is fine here",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "startdatum",
            "ZAC_FORMAAT": "datum"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Startdatum in a date picker",
          "type": "datetime",
          "key": "IN_zaakStartdatumPicker",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: startdatum · no ZAC_FORMAAT — a picker needs the raw ISO value and formats it itself",
          "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
          "enableTime": false,
          "datePicker": {
            "disableWeekends": false,
            "disableWeekdays": false
          },
          "widget": {
            "type": "calendar",
            "displayInTimezone": "viewer",
            "locale": "nl",
            "useLocaleSettings": false,
            "allowInput": true,
            "mode": "single",
            "enableTime": false,
            "noCalendar": false,
            "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
            "hourIncrement": 1,
            "minuteIncrement": 1,
            "time_24hr": true
          },
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "startdatum"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Opgeschort as a word",
          "type": "textfield",
